  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Fire Ward\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Fire-ward.png\" title=\"Image:Skill-_Fire-ward.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Skill-_Fire-ward.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Fire-ward.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Passive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Mage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">15\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">2,281,828\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Passively increases Fire Resistance and reduces all other Resistances while placed in skill tray\n</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>Fire Ward</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Passive\" title=\"Passive\">Passive Skill</a> that simultaneously increases Fire Resistance and decreases all other Resistances. Wards are useful when you enter an area dominated by monsters of one element/type but your resistance to that element is low. Multiple wards can be placed on the skill bar at the same time, but they are designed in such a way that adding more than 2 at a time actually decreases all of your resistances.\n</p><p><br/>\nFire Ward is listed in the following build(s):\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Ranger\" title=\"Critical Ranger\">Critical Ranger</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Ranger\" title=\"Poison Ranger\">Poison Ranger</a>\n</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\nSkills have elements that become stronger when you increase their level at a skill trainer. Below is the skill description with changing values replaced by letters. To find out what Fire Resistance does at some level, refer to the chart and replace the letters in the description below with the values given for the skill level.\n</p><p><br/>\n<b>Passively increase Fire Resistance by X and reduces all other Resistances by Y while placed in your skill tray.</b>\n</p>\n<table align=\"right\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">5\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">6\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">7\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td>30\n</td><td>35\n</td><td>40\n</td><td>45\n</td><td>50\n</td><td>55\n</td><td>60\n</td><td>65\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X\n</td><td>83\n</td><td>96\n</td><td>109\n</td><td>122\n</td><td>135\n</td><td>148\n</td><td>161\n</td><td>174\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Y\n</td><td>42\n</td><td>49\n</td><td>55\n</td><td>62\n</td><td>68\n</td><td>75\n</td><td>81\n</td><td>88\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td>70210\n</td><td>81912\n</td><td>93613\n</td><td>105315\n</td><td>117017\n</td><td>128718\n</td><td>140420\n</td><td>152122\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">9\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">10\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">11\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">12\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">13\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">14\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">15\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td>70\n</td><td>75\n</td><td>80\n</td><td>85\n</td><td>90\n</td><td>95\n</td><td>100\n</td><td> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X\n</td><td>187\n</td><td>200\n</td><td>213\n</td><td>226\n</td><td>239\n</td><td>252\n</td><td>265\n</td><td> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Y\n</td><td>94\n</td><td>101\n</td><td>107\n</td><td>114\n</td><td>120\n</td><td>127\n</td><td>133\n</td><td> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td>163824\n</td><td>175525\n</td><td>187227\n</td><td>198929\n</td><td>210630\n</td><td>222332\n</td><td>234034\n</td><td> \n</td></tr></table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
